<title>JAPAN: Itochu - 6mth group results(SEC).</title>
<headline>Itochu - 6mth group results(SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.12 trln	 vs	    6.49 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   36.41		vs	   40.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax	     31.20		vs	   26.33</p>
<p> Net		    6.31		vs	    5.15</p>
<p> EPS		    4.43 yen	  vs	    3.61 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Itochu Corp is a major trading company. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
